---
// Drainage & French Drain Hydraulic Principles Block
---
<section class="drainage-block-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="drainage-card">
      <div class="drainage-header">
        <div class="drainage-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="drainage-badge">Hydrological Engineering</span>
          <h3>French Drain Anatomy & Pipe Displacement Mechanics</h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="drainage-intro">
        A functioning subsurface French drain or foundation footing trench relies on two principles: free gravity water flow through 38%–42% aggregate void space, and proper mechanical pipe displacement calculation.
      </p>

      <div class="trench-cross-section">
        <div class="trench-step">
          <span class="step-num">Layer 1</span>
          <h4>1% Trench Slope & Non-Woven Wrap</h4>
          <p>Trench floor excavated at 1/8" drop per foot. Lined with 4 oz needle-punched non-woven geotextile with 12" surface overlap.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="trench-step">
          <span class="step-num">Layer 2</span>
          <h4>2" - 3" Clean Bedding Aggregate</h4>
          <p>ASTM #57 washed angular stone placed on trench floor to provide an unyielding, free-draining pipe base.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="trench-step highlight">
          <span class="step-num">Layer 3</span>
          <h4>Perforated Pipe (Holes Down)</h4>
          <p>Perforated corrugated or SDR-35 pipe laid with holes facing DOWN (at 4 and 8 o'clock) so groundwater rises into the pipe and flows away.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="trench-step">
          <span class="step-num">Layer 4</span>
          <h4>Full Stone Encapsulation ("Burrito")</h4>
          <p>Stone filled to 2" below grade, then fabric wrapped tightly across top before adding permeable topsoil or river gravel.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="displacement-calc-card">
        <div class="displacement-title">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
          </svg>
          <h4>Perforated Pipe Displacement Deduction Values</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="displacement-grid">
          <div class="disp-item">
            <span class="disp-label">4-Inch Perforated Pipe:</span>
            <span class="disp-val">Deducts 0.087 cu ft per linear foot</span>
            <span class="disp-detail">(4.35 cu ft or 0.16 yd³ deducted per 50-ft trench)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="disp-item">
            <span class="disp-label">6-Inch Perforated Pipe:</span>
            <span class="disp-val">Deducts 0.196 cu ft per linear foot</span>
            <span class="disp-detail">(9.80 cu ft or 0.36 yd³ deducted per 50-ft trench)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .drainage-block-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) 0;
  }

  .drainage-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .drainage-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .drainage-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    color: #22d3ee;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .drainage-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #22d3ee;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .drainage-header h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .drainage-intro {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .trench-cross-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .trench-cross-section {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .trench-cross-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .trench-step {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .trench-step:hover {
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .trench-step.highlight {
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08) 0%, var(--bg-surface) 100%);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #22d3ee;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .trench-step h4 {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .trench-step p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .displacement-calc-card {
    background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-5);
  }

  .displacement-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    color: #22d3ee;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .displacement-title h4 {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .displacement-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .displacement-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2);
    }
  }

  .disp-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .disp-label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .disp-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #22d3ee;
  }

  .disp-detail {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
